{"ID":"20230925155001-1c9okof","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230925155001-1c9okof","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925155001-1c9okof\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925155004-dojbtuj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925155005-h0i2rbp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925155005-h0i2rbp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"【黄芪芍药桂枝汤】（芪芍桂酒汤）","type":"doc","updated":"20230925155005"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230925155004-dojbtuj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925155004-dojbtuj","updated":"20230925155004"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"组成：黄芪五两、芍药三两、桂枝三两"}]},{"ID":"20230925155004-ep0lmpk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925155004-ep0lmpk","updated":"20230925155004"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右三味，以苦酒一升，水七升，相合，煮取三升，去滓，温服一升，当心烦，服至六七日乃解；若心烦不止者，以苦酒阻故也，以美酒醯易之。"}]},{"ID":"20230925155005-h0i2rbp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925155005-h0i2rbp"}}]}